{"id":"n85872-1-13","stage":5,"title":"호되다 · 狠","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n85872-1-13-1","ko":"반 아이들이 말도 안 듣고 참 짓궂죠?","zh":"班上的孩子们真是不听话，还特别调皮，对吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"반","meaning":"班，班级","explanation":"반：班，班级。","readings":[{"term":"반","audio":"/audio/9f12e26e8d4c016af246.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57301","senseId":"2","lemma":"반","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"반","audio":"/audio/9f12e26e8d4c016af246.mp3"}},{"text":"아이들이","meaning":"小孩，孩子","explanation":"아이：小孩，孩子；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"아이","audio":"/audio/c3d655375e7f3d0484eb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62843","senseId":"1","lemma":"아이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아이들이","audio":"/audio/ac32747784d62b1df40f.mp3"}},{"text":"말도","meaning":"话（말을 듣다：听话）","explanation":"말：话、言语；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"말","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27260","senseId":"2","lemma":"말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"말도","audio":"/audio/6464a9af34c6a3e538bb.mp3"}},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不。","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}},{"text":"듣고","meaning":"得到，挨","explanation":"듣다：得到，挨；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"듣다","audio":"/audio/58977b8705722edc164c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74104","senseId":"5","lemma":"듣다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"듣고","audio":"/audio/7c113616ebd8f8f4a6e2.mp3"}},{"text":"참","meaning":"真，实在，的确","explanation":"참：真，实在，的确。","readings":[{"term":"참","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71761","senseId":"1","lemma":"참","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"참","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3"}},{"text":"짓궂죠?","meaning":"烦人","explanation":"짓궂다：烦人；죠：礼貌地确认、提醒或表达意愿；죠 是 지요 的缩略。","readings":[{"term":"짓궂다","audio":"/audio/477681412a6bbdba5330.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77695","senseId":"1","lemma":"짓궂다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"짓궂죠","audio":"/audio/22101b09428349e3a799.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"9f12e26e8d4c016a","term":"반","zh":"班，班级","audio":"/audio/9f12e26e8d4c016af246.mp3","entryId":"57301","definition":"学校里把一个年级以教室为单位划分的团体。","pronunciation":["반"]},{"id":"c3d655375e7f3d04","term":"아이","zh":"小孩，孩子","audio":"/audio/c3d655375e7f3d0484eb.mp3","entryId":"62843","definition":"年纪小的人。","pronunciation":["아이"]},{"id":"dfbb3ea79fc80c6f","term":"말","zh":"话、言语","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3","entryId":"27260","definition":"话、言语","pronunciation":["말ː"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"58977b8705722edc","term":"듣다","zh":"得到，挨","audio":"/audio/58977b8705722edc164c.mp3","entryId":"74104","definition":"通常指受到上级或长辈的谴责或表扬。","pronunciation":["듣따"]},{"id":"8e09b5f4c09195e3","term":"참","zh":"真，实在，的确","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3","entryId":"71761","definition":"毫不违背事实或道理，真正地。","pronunciation":["참"]},{"id":"477681412a6bbdba","term":"짓궂다","zh":"烦人","audio":"/audio/477681412a6bbdba5330.mp3","entryId":"77695","definition":"欺负折腾别人而惹人厌。","pronunciation":["짇ː꾿따"]}],"audio":"/audio/a145174c7164aaec5290.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n85872-1-13-2","ko":"안 그래도 요전에 호되게 당했어요.","zh":"是啊，我前阵子就因为他们吃了大亏呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不。","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab